comment2.text=\r\n\ Adds\ a\ new\ value\ to\ the\ heap\ and\ bubbles\ it\ up\ to\ proper\ location\r\n\r\n\ @param\ newval\ the\ value\ being\ added\ to\ the\ heap\r\n\ @return\ true\ if\ the\ value\ was\ added\ false\ if\ it\ wasnt\r\n
